OL,3,GNEWSAJersey economy shrinks as profits
OL,4,Afall
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey businesses and workers made less
OL,7,Fmoney in the island last year compared
OL,8,Fto the year before, a report has found.
OL,10,FStatistics Jersey's economy report for
OL,11,F2025 has looked at how much the island
OL,12,Fmakes from various different
OL,13,Findustries.
OL,15,FIt found in 2025 the economy fell
OL,16,Foverall by 1.7% with the Gross Domestic
OL,17,FProduct estimated at #7bn, compared to
OL,18,F#6.9bn in 2024, "driven primarily by
OL,19,Flower profits in the financial and
OL,20,Finsurance sector - particularly within
OL,21,Fbanking".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
