OL,3,GNEWSAJersey economy shrinks as profits
OL,4,Afall
OL,5,
OL,6,FExcluding the finance sector, the rest
OL,7,Fof Jersey's economy recorded "modest
OL,8,Freal-term growth" of 0.2%, it said.
